{"title":"穩定爬坡 VAM:HR（同一路線，參考）","description":"穩定爬坡的有氧效率 VAM:HR：每下心跳換到多少垂直爬升（m/h ÷ bpm），只比同一路線（參考）。\n怎麼看：藍點 = 每段爬坡（實心 = 跑、空心 = 走），橘線 = 這條路線近 8 週的滾動中位數；下拉選路線（反方向另成一條）。可切「熱調整」。沒有可比的段時改畫每次最長的爬坡。\n看什麼：同路線、同走或跑，點往上 = 同樣心率爬得更快。只當參考，不解鎖課表；hover 看溫度和第幾分鐘開始（長爬坡心率會慢慢飄高，Coyle & González-Alonso 2001）。\n方法：基準爬坡的想法來自 Uphill Athlete；VAM ÷ 心率是推估。挑段：坡度 ≥ +8%、連續 ≥ 8 分鐘、停 ≤ 30 秒不算斷（用自己的資料挑，推估），每段前 2 分鐘不算（Hunt：心率 τ ≈ 60 秒）；跑 = 步頻 ≥ 130 spm 過半。熱調整換算到 Hadley 120（每單位 0.224 bpm，自己回測的係數，推估）。","kind":"climbvam","routes":[],"route":null,"counts":{"trail_runs":24,"hikes":14,"no_hr":0,"with_segments":21,"segments":89,"walked":84,"ran":5,"on_route":0,"not_on_route":89,"rejected":{"short":76}},"window_days":56,"beta":0.3,"beta_ref":120.0,"beta_src":"熱 β 0.3 bpm／Hadley（推估：Jenkins 2023 氣溫每 +1 °C 心率 +1 bpm（騎車），換算成熱指數 Hadley（溫度和露點一起升時約 0.29 bpm／Hadley）；本人資料不夠擬合）","heat_basis":"beta","points":[],"median":[],"median_adj":[],"runs_longest":[{"date":"2026-01-11","workout":67,"kind":"trail","longest_s":400.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-03-17","workout":112,"kind":"trail","longest_s":774.0,"segments":2,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-03-22","workout":117,"kind":"trail","longest_s":383.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-03-31","workout":124,"kind":"trail","longest_s":313.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-04-05","workout":129,"kind":"trail","longest_s":355.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-04-14","workout":134,"kind":"trail","longest_s":382.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-04-19","workout":139,"kind":"trail","longest_s":328.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-04-25","workout":144,"kind":"hike","longest_s":2415.0,"segments":8,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-04-26","workout":145,"kind":"trail","longest_s":284.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-05-02","workout":149,"kind":"hike","longest_s":4344.0,"segments":4,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-05-03","workout":150,"kind":"trail","longest_s":380.0,"segments":0,"reason":null},{"date":"2026-05-09","workou